			"notes": "The second release of AutomaticMemories, adding a few community suggested features. (If you want to suggest a feature, open a new issue! They aren't just for bugs.)\n\nNew features are:\n- Enabled toggle to enable/disable the mod (suggested by [bangetto](https://github.com/bangetto))\n- Automatically screenshot important events (currently advancements and deaths; suggested by [NerdSkape](https://github.com/NerdSkape))\n\nNext release we plan to add support for different platforms (like Forge), as well as support for lower versions.\n\nAgain, if you have a suggestion, open a new issue or check out our [discord](https://discord.gg/2pn53HV)"
